Z||000000||Rodrv6||01-27-2000||11:32 PM||||I finally got around to installing the headliner kit that I bought from the Fiero Store a couple of months ago.  I was a little concerned about how it would look since I have the "Vista Vent" roof and I knew I would have to cut and fit the fabric into the groove in the roof cutout.  I did a trial fit of the fiberglass backing board and did not have to do any trimming at all! It fit perfectly!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  After gluing the fabric to the backing board, I installed the unit into the car and trimmed and tucked the fabric around the rood opening.  Only took about 2 hours start to finish and looks GREAT!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Only drawback is it makes the rest of the interior look a little dingy. I guess that will give me something else to do later.||||reg||6
